.377, "end": 37.983, "text": "Ty widzisz podgląd posta na LinkedIn, poprawiasz co trzeba i klikasz akceptuj.", "words": [{"text": "Ty", "start": 33.377, "end": 33.597}, {"text": "widzisz", "start": 33.638, "end": 33.918}, {"text": "podgląd", "start": 33.998, "end": 34.378}, {"text": "posta", "start": 34.419, "end": 34.699}, {"text": "na", "start": 34.739, "end": 34.819}, {"text": "LinkedIn,", "start": 34.859, "end": 35.44}, {"text": "poprawiasz", "start": 35.46, "end": 35.88}, {"text": "co", "start": 35.94, "end": 36.021}, {"text": "trzeba", "start": 36.081, "end": 36.541}, {"text": "i", "start": 36.581, "end": 36.641}, {"text": "klikasz", "start": 36.701, "end": 37.022}, {"text": "akceptuj.", "start": 37.082, "end": 37.983}]}, {"start": 38.023, "end": 41.968, "text": "Dopiero wtedy post trafia do kolejki i wychodzi w ustalonym slocie.", "words": [{"text": "Dopiero", "start": 38.023, "end": 38.283}, {"text": "wtedy", "start": 38.324, "end": 38.724}, {"text": "post", "start": 38.804, "end": 39.085}, {"text": "trafia", "start": 39.165, "end": 39.425}, {"text": "do", "start": 39.445, "end": 39.525}, {"text": "kolejki", "start": 39.565, "end": 40.066}, {"text": "i", "start": 40.146, "end": 40.186}, {"text": "wychodzi", "start": 40.226, "end": 40.586}, {"text": "w", "start": 40.626, "end": 40.647}, {"text": "ustalonym", "start": 40.687, "end": 41.127}, {"text": "slocie.", "start": 41.187, "end": 41.968}]}, {"start": 42.068, "end": 44.672, "text": "Nic nie publikuje się bez Twojej zgody.", "words": [{"text": "Nic", "start": 42.068, "end": 42.369}, {"text": "nie", "start": 42.409, "end": 42.489}, {"text": "publikuje", "start": 42.529, "end": 43.01}, {"text": "się", "start": 43.03, "end": 43.13}, {"text": "bez", "start": 43.17, "end": 43.29}, {"text": "Twojej", "start": 43.33, "end": 43.61}, {"text": "zgody.", "start": 43.65, "end": 44.672}]}, {"start": 44.732, "end": 45.813, "text": "Draft Manager.", "words": [{"text": "Draft", "start": 44.732, "end": 45.012}, {"text": "Ma